#: of pams.market.Market:1
msgid "Market class."
msgstr "市場クラス。"

#: of pams.market.Market:3
msgid ""
"If ``transaction_fee`` is set (see :class:`pams.TransactionFee`), the "
"market charges transaction fees to the buyer and the seller of each "
"execution and records the net transaction fees that it collects in each "
"time step, which :func:`get_transaction_fee_revenues` and "
":func:`get_transaction_fee_revenue` return, and "
":func:`get_cumulative_transaction_fee_revenue` returns their sum up to a "
"time step. A logger can read them through ``log.market`` in "
":func:`pams.logs.Logger.process_market_step_end_log`, and an event can "
"read them through ``market`` in "
":func:`pams.events.EventABC.hooked_after_step_for_market`, e.g.,"
msgstr ""
"``transaction_fee`` が設定されている場合（:class:`pams.TransactionFee` "
"を参照）、市場は各約定の買い手と売り手に取引手数料を課し、各ステップで徴収した取引手数料の純額を記録します。記録した値は "
":func:`get_transaction_fee_revenues` と "
":func:`get_transaction_fee_revenue` で、あるステップまでの合計は "
":func:`get_cumulative_transaction_fee_revenue` で取得できます。ロガーは "
":func:`pams.logs.Logger.process_market_step_end_log` の ``log.market`` "
"を通じて、イベントは :func:`pams.events.EventABC.hooked_after_step_for_market` の "
"``market`` を通じてそれらを読み取れます。例えば次のようにします："

