#: of pams.market.Market.get_transaction_fee_revenue:1
msgid "Get the transaction fees collected by this market in a time step."
msgstr "あるステップにこの市場が徴収した取引手数料を取得します。"

#: of pams.market.Market.get_transaction_fee_revenue:3
#: pams.market.Market.get_transaction_fee_revenues:3
msgid ""
"The transaction fee revenue of a time step is the sum of the transaction "
"fees charged to the buyers and the sellers of the executions in that time"
" step. Negative fees (rebates) reduce it, so it can be negative. It is "
"0.0 if the market has no transaction fee."
msgstr ""
"あるステップの取引手数料収入は、そのステップの約定の買い手と売り手に課された取引手数料の合計です。負の手数料（リベート）はこれを減らすため、負になることもあります。市場に取引手数料がない場合は"
" 0.0 です。"

#: of pams.market.Market.get_transaction_fee_revenue:11
msgid "transaction fee revenue."
msgstr "取引手数料収入。"

#: of pams.market.Market.get_transaction_fee_revenues:1
